			"notes": "- Default tools will have the \"Standard\" modifier applied to them. Since modifiers are only applied when crafting or smithing, this has no effect on tools that are spawned from the creative inventory or generated in chests (Will be changed soon)\n- Added the Sharpening Stone\n- The Sharpening Stone fully repairs a tool, giving it full durability\n- The sharpening stone is crafted with 8 diamonds and 1 stone block in a crafting table\n- Fixed a bug with the Smithing Workbench\n- Adjusted the description of the smithing stones to be more in-line with the Smithing Workbench\n- Added a sound that plays when using the smithing table\n- The resultant item in the Smithing Workbench is now more accurate to the stone being used\n- Smithing stone recipe now gives 2 stones\n- Changed the textures of all smithing stones to be more in-line with ingot textures\n- Legendary modifiers are rarer"
		},
